 - `eth1`: about 0.0465 ETH, assuming each Ethereum transaction's 0.0003 ETH gas comes out of the ETH balance.\n  - `rh1`: about 0.0500465 ETH.\n  - `arb1`: 147.6996 USDC plus about 0.000813 ETH.\n- **Timing:** quotes expire after 300 s, and the four 60 s bridges mean the route will take roughly 4–5 minutes. I'll run one leg at a time, size each next leg from the balance that actually arrived, and get fresh prices for any legs whose quotes expire. If a fresh price takes the total over $10.2208, I'll come back to you before going further.\n\nDo you approve, refuse, or want to set a lower cost cap?"}]},{"role":"user","sequence":24,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":25,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Approved. Executing leg 1 (q_1: ETH→WBTC on `eth1`)."},{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_10"},"id":"toolu_015UdU58EJ7hJNHmh1CErjnG"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":26,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_11\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_015UdU58EJ7hJNHmh1CErjnG","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":27,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_11"},"id":"toolu_01JkAcLH7hwd1fS3Rw1SBRka"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":28,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01JkAcLH7hwd1fS3Rw1SBRka","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":29,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"eth1","asset":"WBTC"},"id":"toolu_017oFepxxedGYGXbeuW3AYFA"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":30,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"amount\":\"495000\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_017oFepxxedGYGXbeuW3AYFA","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","isError":false}]},{"r